# R8 / memory limits (Android 17)
#
# Targeting API 37, the system can terminate processes that exceed device-RAM-based
# anonymous+swap limits. ApplicationExitInfo.getDescription() may contain
# "MemoryLimiter:AnonSwap" in that case.
#
# Use R8 in full mode (minifyEnabled / optimization.enable) for release so unused
# classes, methods, and fields are stripped. This sample keeps optimization off in
# debug so the educational API surface is easy to inspect in the APK Analyzer.
#
# If you enable R8, keep JobService and AppFunction entry points that are only
# referenced from the manifest / system binder.

-keep class com.rick.apiupgrade37.jobs.DebugSampleJobService { *; }
